{"id":"wx2652900033","title":"今天，致敬伟大胜利！","published_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:23+08:00","published_label":"2026-10-22","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAD1ozrbbiaEniazFbjVYnM0wibq4kCbb4aEk1mKPtMYMmicviaQzkvLfvOR0llAbib8onMqoFAcibZOumwMjiabcAiaxYTukryRzgEclF0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"1936年深秋，朔风漫过黄土高原。历经长途艰难跋涉，红一、红四方面军会师会宁，红一、红二方面军会师将台堡，实现三大主力红军会师…","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652900033&idx=1&sn=4fc260a1cd785c0bde67e5a07712d808","paper_url":null,"word_count":1856,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:20:39+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCJXoKltTrU8Oou8qoCRIiaXobXjmia1llJmZ6b8juYsol9M0anvARoCklPI07ElPnA8dP0QfNB5dvEfgDwkQrluiaPy0fu1raRjE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1936年深秋，朔风漫过黄土高原。历经长途艰难跋涉，红一、红四方面军会师会宁，红一、红二方面军会师将台堡，实现三大主力红军会师。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>漫漫征途，红军将士以信念为炬、以血肉为盾，击退上百万穷凶极恶的追兵阻敌，征服空气稀薄的冰山雪岭，穿越渺无人烟的沼泽草地，在绝境中挺立，在困顿中突围。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>长征是20世纪最能影响世界前途的重要事件之一，是中国共产党和红军肩负起民族希望北上抗日的战略转移，实现了中国共产党和中国革命事业从挫折走向胜利的伟大转折，对中华民族历史进程具有十分深远的影响。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBpqib6gSfhzlZOeQxRictSTktrYr05JictialUMVDLmnQQWxgXZfMnztnEbkkNAd02qm4RshGA2byoZJN4ibWYvoicugAB4pXcjjTVs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><strong><span><span>今天，我们一起回望</span></span></strong></span></section><p><span><span>这条用热血浇筑的信仰之路</span></span></p><p><span><span>致敬长征胜利九十周年的初心征程</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XF3R4vwtOolNkkr3aHQqkwIib2ib52ibyo6wZKplJ5z3LolrCHsRBA11zRibkvjPFK6CEk9tL0ERbnIJxsUV0v6jd0G2Kibu3f6RSgQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;wxfrom=13&amp;tp=wxpic#imgIndex=2\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>▲油画《雪山铁流》 作者/沈尧伊</span></span></p><p><span><span>千千万万战士</span></span></p><p><span><span>面前，是弹雨犁过的沟坎</span></span></p><p><span><span>身后，是敌机撕咬的险关</span></span></p><p><span><span>脚下，是层层磨穿的草鞋</span></span></p><p><span><span>凭着胸中滚烫的信念</span></span></p><p><span><span>硬是把绝路走成大道</span></span></p><p><span><span>铸就人类历史上的伟大壮举</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XFgTmwheL6CN3qEyj5P7Tj5CjhMk2fXJzict8RoKKedxImicXfic3y0VaIJ2Bs6HIbJZmneR8hneBqn1b3sRhpb9Jta0hKJIDmVkY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=3\"/></section><section><section><section><span><span>▲</span></span><span><span>油画《红军过草地》 作者/张文源</span></span></section><section><span><span>九十多年前</span></span></section><section><span><span>没有惊天动地的豪言</span></span></section><section><span><span>一次决然的开拔</span></span></section><section><span><span>便把信仰刻进了骨血里</span></span></section><section><span><span>山河辗转</span></span></section><section><span><span>那些留在征途上的身影从未被遗忘</span></span></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XGRyvoEV7IDN3TwopkZiaayzSOzFX2MNl8kFx9AlXib94PibsFReicdiaX3UAYHNwpffsibqYVfOSUGaqsjatWxhS1LQN8wlmmicGDFOY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=4\"/></section><section><span><span>▲</span></span><span><span>油画《飞夺泸定桥》 作者/刘国枢</span></span></section><section><span><span>从</span><span>血战湘江</span><span>的生死鏖战</span></span></section><section><span><span>到</span></span><span><span>遵义会议</span><span>的</span><span>拨正航向</span></span></section><section><span><span>从</span><span>四渡赤水</span><span>的巧破困局</span></span></section><section><span><span>到</span><span>翻越夹金山</span><span>的苦寒跋涉</span></span></section><section><span><span>不断有人倒下</span></span></section><section><span><span>不断有人跟上</span></span></section><section><span><span>这支队伍始终怀揣远大理想</span></span></section><section><span><span>在最黑的夜里</span></span></section><section><span><span>走最长的路</span></span></section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XHxZ2NB13I8wUywkj7cpV5V41y6DvwPxYuME7kvryvLD58bxjqjAJdVdKo1Ok0XOcic4Y96GsbDyONVeXxzWK7Qoc0PzibWDXoYc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=10\"/></section><section><span><span>▲</span></span><span><span>油画《三大主力</span></span><span><span>会师》 </span></span><span><span>作者</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span><span>蔡亮 张自嶷</span></span></span></section><p><span><span>当年的雪山草地</span></span></p><p><span><span>如今已是草木葱茏</span></span></p><p><span><span>曾经险关天堑</span></span></p><p><span><span>早已化作通途大道</span></span></p><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XG1QoRmPU3ZjY2bibDsI75Qyiby6UPqBwl9KZwJicScwoPPBrB0QZpprp7wsTVVfY6asaicLI9JT8FDRRsXhUf9OFwAz0b0tPibHySY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=11\"/></section><section><section><span><span>▲</span></span><span><span>九十多年前</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>中央红军在</span></span><span><span>贵州省黔西南州</span></span><span><span>贞丰境内连续架起3座浮桥，越过</span></span><span><span><span>北盘江</span></span><span><span>天险</span></span></span><span><span>；如今，</span><span>花</span></span><span><span>江峡谷大桥</span><span>横跨两岸，将2个多小时的盘山路缩短至数分钟路程。</span></span></section><section><p><span><span>今天的</span><span>中国</span></span></p><p><span><span>正跨越一道道新的沟坎</span></span></p><section><span><span>攻克了一个个“娄山关”“腊子口”</span></span></section><p><span><span>在新的长征路上大步前进</span></span></p><span><span>高端制造、人工智能……火遍全球</span></span></section><section><span><span>把一个个“不可能</span></span><span><span>”</span></span></section><section><span><span>变成了一项项“已完成</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XFw75PZduLUTibzbCp32h0xicdXibeILMcdqISCNBFRVTBrykTYnGu9PESUN3aff5g9fxhGeS3GUE183Pt8IVstaQR2qRCSAeYgPc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=12\"/></section></section><span><span>▲</span></span><span><span>今年9月，</span></span><span><span>西部陆海新</span><span>通道骨干工程平陆运河建</span><span>成通航。</span></span></section><p><span><span>今天的</span><span>中国人</span></span></p><p><span><span>正站在新的长征渡口</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>置身科技封锁与经济转型的激流</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>直面考验，顶住压力</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>在惊涛骇浪中</span></span><span><span>稳住航向</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>把发</span></span><span><span>展的命运牢牢掌握在自己手中</span></span></p><p><span><span>用志气开辟道路</span></span></p><p><span><span>用底气走向未来</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XFgCpoe5OmEhAkI4EA1ZoovicF06icVFeF3AiczX9zZmFh1zPnAnEgbgwmZ6X7W4ic4QDPDEIjtsNZBEXNFKZ0iaylkicVjzDDDUcMAc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=13\"/></section></section><span><span>▲</span></span><span><span>中国机器人产业加速领跑。图为</span></span><span><span>第二届世界人形机器人运动会开幕式机器人方阵。</span></span></section><p><span><span>今天的</span><span>中华民族</span></span></p><p><span><span>接续这份红色薪火</span></span></p><p><span><span>生死相依、患难与共</span></span></p><p><span><span>艰苦奋斗的伟大</span></span><span><span>长征精神</span></span></p><p><span><span>永远不会褪色</span></span></p><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JPu5lvAD1XEa1otva8aZJIHkgaQdViaS8TjPUI9rSicCXfia6KLuSfTugICYJ8tq590p23kPxic6liaWVOibeFNjadXEXmavQyKhJmzrQyctzYGO8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=wxpic&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=14\"/></section></section></section><span><span>▲ 如今的港口航运联通世界</span></span></section><p><span><span>每一代人，有每一代人的长征路</span></span></p><p><span><span>新的长征路上，我们继续出发</span></span></p><p><span><span>每一程跋涉，都是对初心的回望</span></span></p><p><span><span>每一次出发，都带着星火燎原的力量</span></span></p><p><span><span>九十年后的今天</span></span></p><p><span><span>我们依然走在这条路上</span></span></p><p><span><span>山河为证，信仰滚烫</span></span></p><p><span><span>致敬先烈，</span></span><span><span>赓续薪火</span></span></p><p><span><span>华南农业大学结合</span></span></p><p><span><span>开学典礼、国庆升旗</span></span></p><p><span><span>军训拉练、</span></span><span><span>文艺晚会等</span></span><span><span>思政育人场景</span></span></p><p><span><span>围绕长征胜利九十周年主题</span></span></p><p><span><span>开展各类纪念活动</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckB0ZZ05EiaRpM9kA1R4brgvO5YCkGCrrSObQcmo1ofblDXwsWjL7zFMwuibspI1hyrkWnb1oIZBzw20y8DRBVicnuWuyqwA5720M8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDNxzOgDibJdvzoMrcjGTNyRweuhiaQFFb1sW3afl529IBBPqOehpQ5EMDeeKuG089q31enDOlur1vUgT2u4Qb1j3zZPyiaXjicF1M/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>▲华农2026年开学典礼以“家”为情感纽带，将长征精神、华农老一辈科学家事迹、卢永根院士的赤子情怀与新生教育深度融合，为全体新生上了一堂厚重而温暖的“家国大课”。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDTpiagmQwL7JogvWJL0ibxHiathrGR37btpxqbbNZgvoHlhv2dkOOjPkDCHrLppG6RusdAK5nDLm99FQDmXxBfSY0xK2icFicqEkcM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAnnWiaQvvA7ugqYTrV61cVdyRKBn88LcEhPibWjvq0xkPj4qTkDPqr9drJKElXZIPzqdWAW2R1UL7mwe9yyXRUYT6xSly2gjId4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>▲华农2026级新生军训融入长征精神，开展环校10公里夜间徒步行军拉练活动，组织开展主题朗诵、军歌合唱比赛，</span></span><span><span>用红色文化滋养青年思想，</span></span><span><span>将长征精神代代相传。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckD1WFrDibK425rZdur50TV6pLC2lAvGicZTPsPMUpwlibwPo7icjEcCYicqM3e5Dmrz4YMgcOV5DLyC9FNUNRtalBY3FhtNVSzcMVjA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBokfWkllbwyejknOSrcRv5z6dwAsrXXyrwibDQYHBvz2GO5BEHBJdxoeIzmvLQGZ7WCLIRMytF8ejlibboByDRnWFEo1wV65UgI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>▲</span></span><span><span>10月1日，华农在行政楼广场隆重举行升旗仪式。活动现场，华农学子与汇景实验中学、华农附小的同学们同台，朗诵原创诗歌《一代人有一代人的长征路》，将华农人的奋斗故事娓娓道来，传递“承长征精神，续农科学脉，少年有志，逐梦四方”的志向。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCVUEo21UeuRMdFy4Kyy2eeGvZ5TGFkwq4MdQx6BIJyPCzD0eRe1uL3GBz9zFbEvhuMYkUSpQoe4g6PWia9uUzvT2u4ibgZjyCUs/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAc8Xa3CY6yUH68qn4Z1UWLh7TWqIgRjk5bhS968icI1VgfFxDsvAnLG5j3HUSzDoBm8tVwx4V5cjnVpyz06BwHG5cXWh8D2pFM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckA2vOMjzw34Y729K7xygSgJZicArULxEMM5nh5ZYIQ2VElT157K6MhkRhMAjHlkBo4ibYEch351huYiadhV3QxNdFMule77MWQAho/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>▲华农2026年迎新晚会以“赓续长征星火，躬耕紫荆年华”为主题，带来一场意蕴深厚的文化盛宴。晚会上，合唱《忆秦娥・娄山关》、舞台剧《家灯・国魂》、朗诵《长征薪火映华农》等精彩节目上演，追忆长征岁月，传承红色薪火。</span></span></p><p><span><span>“一代人有一代人的长征”</span></span></p><p><span><span>“新征程是新的长征”</span></span></p><p><span><span>厚生利世担使命，抱朴鼎新报国心</span></span></p><p><span><span>华南农业大学</span></span></p><p><span><span>将不忘立德树人初心</span></span></p><p><span><span>牢记强农兴农使命</span></span></p><p><span><span>攻坚实干、跨越争先</span></span></p><p><span><span>奋力建设农业特色世界一流大学</span></span></p><p><span><span>为加快建成教育强国和农业强国</span></span></p><p><span><span>实现中华民族伟大复兴的中国梦</span></span></p><p><span><span>作出新的更大贡献！</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652898561&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ccfc9c449d0efa4084c5478578c79403&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBXZP5v1OQU0Coickj4bGyhHekt8ys3DSSTWfX0CZS2tLh2s4tD4ZA6xG5jUUpyicyEZlrk5oyeN5YmiamSmHFr1kblnQCl1IicvrI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span>特别的爱，集体表白</span><span>！</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652899473&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6835ee87c15802c14b31c30659fcd1a3&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAI5GMhmJ6FVjyc7K9EJBG3ia4PvaUQRmKJQwEJqSZhwJfjflcXic43y4v1baro7KC